### Step 5: Refinement

You can further refine the slider by adding animations, adjusting the radius limits, or implementing a drag event listener to allow users to dynamically change the radius as they drag the mouse.

Remember to test your slider on different devices and browsers to ensure it works as expected and looks good on various screen sizes.

