3. **Create the view controller for the extension**: The iMessage extension will need a view controller that hosts the buttons. Create a new Swift file and name it `ButtonViewController.swift`. Inherit from `MSMessagesAppViewController`.

```swift
import Messages

class ButtonViewController: MSMessagesAppViewController {

    // 1. Add outlets for the buttons
    @IBOutlet weak var button1: MSButton!
    @IBOutlet weak var button2: MSButton!

    // 2. Override the viewDidLoad method to set up the buttons
    override func viewDidLoad() {
        super.viewDidLoad()
        setupButtons()
    }

